// Kit
@1 = ~black dragon disciple~
@2 = ~Black Dragon Disciple~
@3 = ~BLACK DRAGON DISCIPLE: The blood of a black dragon runs in the veins of these sorcerers. Unlike other Dragon Disciples, they are not born with their ancestor's gifts: claws, scales, breath and wings lie dormant in their blood. Each one must be awakened by choice, and every awakening costs a part of the sorcerer's magic, forever.

Advantages:
- Hit Die: d6 instead of d4.
- May select unique Draconic Transformation when gaining new level, at the cost of learning a new spell.

DRACONIC TRANSFORMATIONS: The transformations appear among the spells the Black Dragon Disciple can learn. Cast once, a transformation changes him permanently; its effects persist through death and cannot be dispelled. Effects that grow with level keep growing after the transformation, and a transformation taken late grants at once the steps already reached.

Disadvantages:
- One spell slot less per spell level.
- Each Draconic Transformation permanently removes one spell slot of its level.~


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Transformations (spells)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@100 = ~Claw & Bite~
@101 = ~Claw & Bite
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

Black claws grow on both hands of the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains two claw attacks dealing 1d4 slashing damage each, with no two-weapon penalty, and a +4 bonus to THAC0 with them. The claws count as +1 magical weapons, +2 at level 10, +3 at level 15, +4 at level 20 and +5 at level 25.

Each successful attack has a 20% chance to provoke a bite, dealing 1d6 piercing and 1d4 acid damage.

The innate abilities Retract Claws and Extend Claws dismiss or summon them at will. The claws take the first weapon slot and the shield slot.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@102 = ~Dragon Scale~
@103 = ~Dragon Scale
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

Black scales cover the skin of the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains a permanent +3 bonus to Armor Class, +4 at level 10 and +5 at level 15.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@104 = ~Breath Weapon~
@105 = ~Breath Weapon
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 2
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple gains a new innate ability, Black Dragon Breath: a line of acid dealing 4d4 acid damage, 6d4 from level 7 and 8d4 from level 10 (save vs. Breath for half). The breath ignores magic resistance. Once used, it recharges in 10 rounds.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@106 = ~Draconic Resilience~
@107 = ~Draconic Resilience
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 2
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The body of the Black Dragon Disciple hardens like a dragon's. He gains +2 Constitution, +4 from level 15, and immunity to critical hits. The resilient skull takes the helmet slot.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@108 = ~Draconic Tail~
@109 = ~Draconic Tail
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 3
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple grows a powerful tail. Once per round, a hostile creature in close range takes 2d6 crushing damage and is knocked prone for 1 second if it fails a save vs. Breath.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@110 = ~Swamp Stride~
@111 = ~Swamp Stride
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 3
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple moves through swamps and their poisons like a black dragon. He becomes immune to poison, and to Grease, Entangle, Web, Stinking Cloud and Spike Growth.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@112 = ~Acidosis~
@113 = ~Acidosis
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 4
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The blood of the Black Dragon Disciple turns to acid. He gains 50% acid resistance and deals 20% more acid damage. Below 50% health, he deals 1d2 acid damage to his attackers.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@114 = ~Black Dragon Magic~
@115 = ~Black Dragon Magic
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 4
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple learns 3 lower-level spells normally unavailable to sorcerers: Entangle, Darkness and Summon Insect.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@116 = ~Draconic Might~
@117 = ~Draconic Might
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 5
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The strength of a dragon fills the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains +2 Strength, +4 from level 15, and immunity to paralysis and sleep.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@118 = ~Meta-breath~
@119 = ~Meta-breath
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 5
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple learns to shape his breath. Black Dragon Breath now offers three forms: the line, Breath Ball and Breath Pool. All of them share the same charge. Recharge: line 6 rounds, Breath Pool 8 rounds, Breath Ball 10 rounds.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@120 = ~Blindsense~
@121 = ~Blindsense
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 6
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple perceives his surroundings without relying on sight. He becomes immune to blindness, can see and attack invisible enemies, and his vision range slightly increases.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@122 = ~Acid Mastery~
@123 = ~Acid Mastery
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 6
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The acid of the Black Dragon Disciple eats through armor. He gains 50% acid resistance. The acid of his breath and of his bite reduces the target's Armor Class by 2 for 2 rounds.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@124 = ~Dragon Wings~
@125 = ~Dragon Wings
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 7
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

Leathery wings tear through the back of the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains +4 movement speed and the innate ability Wing Buffet, usable at will and recharging in 4 rounds.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@126 = ~Draconic Majesty~
@127 = ~Draconic Majesty
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 7
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple carries the presence of an ancient wyrm. He gains +2 Charisma, +2 Intelligence and +50 Lore, and may use Charm Reptile 3 times per day.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@128 = ~Frightful Presence~
@129 = ~Frightful Presence
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 8
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple gains the innate ability Frightful Presence, an aura of draconic menace he turns on or off at will.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@130 = ~Greater Black Dragon Magic~
@131 = ~Greater Black Dragon Magic
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 8
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple learns 3 lower-level spells normally unavailable to sorcerers: Corrupt Water, Insect Plague and Dolorous Decay.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@132 = ~Dragon Apotheosis~
@133 = ~Dragon Apotheosis
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 9
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple becomes one with the dragon within. He gains +2 Constitution, +2 Strength, +2 Charisma and +4 Armor Class.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~

@134 = ~Breath Mastery~
@135 = ~Breath Mastery
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 9
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The breath of the Black Dragon Disciple reaches its full strength. The damage dice of all his breaths are doubled (8d4, 12d4, 16d4) and all their recharge times are 2 rounds shorter.

This draconic transformation is cast only once: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It permanently removes one spell slot of its level. Casting it again has no effect.~


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Abilities and items given by the transformations
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@200 = ~Draconic Claws~
@201 = ~Draconic Claws

The black claws of the Black Dragon Disciple. Each successful attack has a 20% chance to provoke a bite, dealing 1d6 piercing and 1d4 acid damage.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +4
Damage: 1d4 (slashing)
No two-weapon penalty~
@202 = ~Extend Claws~
@203 = ~Extend Claws

The Black Dragon Disciple extends his claws: they take the first weapon slot and the shield slot. They can be retracted at will.~
@204 = ~Retract Claws~
@205 = ~Retract Claws

The Black Dragon Disciple retracts his claws and frees his hands. They can be extended again at will.~
@206 = ~Draconic Bite~

@210 = ~Black Dragon Breath~
@211 = ~Black Dragon Breath

The Black Dragon Disciple exhales a line of acid. Creatures in the line take acid damage (save vs. Breath for half); the breath ignores magic resistance. Once used, it recharges after a few rounds.~
@212 = ~Breath Line~
@213 = ~Breath Line

A line of acid. Creatures in the line take acid damage (save vs. Breath for half); the breath ignores magic resistance.~
@214 = ~Breath Ball~
@215 = ~Breath Ball

A ball of acid bursts at the targeted point, 20-ft. radius. Creatures in the area, allies included, take acid damage (save vs. Breath for half); the breath ignores magic resistance.~
@216 = ~Breath Pool~
@217 = ~Breath Pool

A pool of acid spreads on the ground for 1 turn, 7.5-ft. radius. Each round, creatures in the pool take acid damage (save vs. Breath for half); the breath ignores magic resistance. The Black Dragon Disciple is not affected by his own pool.~
@218 = ~Draconic Skull~
@219 = ~Draconic Skull

The hardened skull of the Black Dragon Disciple protects him from critical hits.~

@220 = ~Draconic Tail~

@230 = ~Frightful Presence~
@231 = ~Frightful Presence

The Black Dragon Disciple emanates an aura of draconic menace. Enemies of a lower level than his within 10 ft. must save vs. Spell or panic for 2 rounds. A creature that succeeds becomes immune to the aura for 24 hours. Allies are not affected.

Using this ability turns the aura on; it can then be turned off at will.~
@232 = ~Dismiss Frightful Presence~
@233 = ~Dismiss Frightful Presence

Turns off the aura of Frightful Presence. It can be turned on again at will.~

@240 = ~Wing Buffet~
@241 = ~Wing Buffet

The Black Dragon Disciple beats his wings, knocking down and pushing back the creatures around him. Once used, it recharges in 4 rounds.~

@250 = ~Charm Reptile~
@251 = ~Charm Reptile

The Black Dragon Disciple bends a reptile to his will: lizard men, wyverns, basilisks, hydras, nagas and their kin are charmed for 1 hour, with no saving throw and regardless of their magic resistance. Dragons are not affected.~


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Spells learned through Black Dragon Magic and its greater versions
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@260 = ~Darkness~
@261 = ~Darkness
(Alteration)

Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

The caster surrounds himself with a cloud of magical darkness. Every creature in the area, ally or enemy, becomes invisible and blinded for 3 rounds.~

@262 = ~Corrupt Water~
@263 = ~Corrupt Water
(Alteration)

Level: 4
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

A foul rain falls on the area and leaves a pool of rotten water on the ground for 1 turn. The potions carried by the creatures in the area are spoiled and destroyed. Each round, creatures in the water must save vs. Death or be poisoned for 1 round.~

@264 = ~Summon Reptile~
@265 = ~Summon Reptile
(Conjuration)

Level: 8
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round per level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The caster calls a hydra to fight at his side.~

@266 = ~Swampy Lake~
@267 = ~Swampy Lake
(Conjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

A lake of acid swallows the area for 1 turn. Each round, creatures in the lake take 4d6 acid damage (save vs. Breath for half). The caster is not affected.~

@270 = ~Half Black Dragon Spirit~


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// High-level abilities
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@300 = ~Breath Doom~
@301 = ~Breath Doom

The Black Dragon Disciple unleashes the full fury of his ancestor: a huge cone of acid. Acid version of Dragon's Breath, which is no longer available to the Black Dragon Disciple.~
@302 = ~Call Ancestor~
@303 = ~Call Ancestor

The Black Dragon Disciple calls the spirit of a half black dragon ancestor to fight at his side. Replaces Summon Planetar and Summon Dark Planetar.~
@304 = ~Bonemelt~
@305 = ~Bonemelt

A powerful single-target acid spell. The target takes 4d4 acid damage per round for 10 rounds. Skeletons are destroyed instantly.~
@306 = ~Black Dragon Magic Mastery~
@307 = ~Black Dragon Magic Mastery

The Black Dragon Disciple learns 3 spells of levels 7, 8 and 9 normally unavailable to sorcerers: Creeping Doom, Summon Reptile and Swampy Lake.~
